        transliteration: "premāñjana-cchurita-bhakti-vilocanena\nsantaḥ sadaiva hṛdayeṣu vilokayanti\nyaṁ śyāmasundaram acintya-guṇa-svarūpaṁ\ngovindam ādi-puruṣaṁ tam ahaṁ bhajāmi",
        translation: "I worship Govinda, the primeval Lord, who is Syamasundara, Krishna Himself with inconceivable innumerable attributes, whom the pure devotees see in their heart of hearts with the eye of devotion tinged with the salve of love.",
