                "transliteration": "\u015bloka 11.5: karma\u1e47y ev\u0101dhik\u0101ras te m\u0101 phale\u1e63u kad\u0101cana\nm\u0101 karma-phala-hetur bh\u016br m\u0101 te sa\u1e45go 'stv akarma\u1e47i",
